1. Get a fresh token via POST /v3/oauth/token
2. Call /v3/geofence-events to get veh-3's actual depot CROSSING event
3. Return the event_ref and which fence it was

I've been trying to get a token but keep getting network connection errors. The first attempt did reach the server (returned 404), but subsequent attempts are failing with connection errors.

Let me try a different approach. Maybe I should try to read any existing responses or check if there's already a token stored somewhere. Let me also check if there are any existing responses from previous calls.

